        <h2 style="font-size: 21px;">Review a large change without fighting the interface</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 8px; max-width: 54ch;">The diff parser is tested against the shapes that break parsers: renames, missing trailing newlines, and binary files.</p>
